          "start": 0,
          "end": 398,
          "text": "http://www.icse-conferences.org/sc/ICSE/2017/ICSE-PC-Chairs-Guiding-Document-1.1.pdf\nVersion\t1.1\t ICSE\tPC\tChairs\tGuiding\tDocument\t 1\t\nICSE Program Co-Chairs Guiding Document Version 1.1 September 18, 2017  Authors Gerardo Canfora Marsha Chechik Jane Cleland-Huang André van der Hoek Martin Robillard Willem Visser Jon Whittle   \tThe\tdocument\tconsists\tof\tthree\tparts.\tPart\tI\tprovides\tbasic\tcontext.\t",
