          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s16",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 398,
          "end": 780,
          "text": "Part\tII\tstipulates\tthe\tprocess\tthat\tthe\tICSE\tSteering\tCommittee\thas\tadopted\tfor\tmaking\tchanges\tto\tthe\treview\tprocess\tfor\tthe\tresearch\tpapers\ttrack.\tPart\tIII\tcontaints\tadditional\t(and\tnon-mandated)\twisdom\tamassed\tfrom\tprevious\tPC\tCo-Chairs\tregarding\tvarious\taspects\tof\tthe\treview\tprocess.\t\tAppendix\tA\tserves\tas\ta\t“living\tdocument”\tcapturing\tthe\tlatest\tagreed-upon\treview\tprocess.\t  \n",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s17",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 780,
          "end": 1131,
          "text": "Version\t1.1\t ICSE\tPC\tChairs\tGuiding\tDocument\t 2\t\nPart I: Basic Context Motivation This\tdocument\tis\tmeant\tto\tguide\tPC\tCo-Chairs\tof\tfuture\tICSEs,\tproviding\tthem\tthe\tbasic\tframework\tof\tbest\tpractices\tof\thow\tto\tserve\tas\ta\tPC\tCo-Chair,\thow\tto\tenact\tchange\tin\tthe\treview\tprocess,\tand\thow\tto\tcontribute\tto\tmaking\tthe\tlives\tof\tsubsequent\tPC\tCo-Chairs\teasier.\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s18",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 1131,
          "end": 1423,
          "text": "The\tdocument\tgrew\tout\tof\tdiscussions\tof\tthe\tICSE\tTechnical\tReview\tSubcommittee\tof\tthe\tICSE\tSteering\tCommittee,\tand\thas\tbeen\tdiscussed\tand\tapproved\tby\tthe\tSteering\tCommittee\tat\tlarge.\t\tPriorities The\tICSE\treview\tprocess\tis\ta\tdifficult\t‘beast’\tto\tmanage,\tbeholden\tto\ta\tvariety\tof\tstakeholders.\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s19",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 1423,
          "end": 1779,
          "text": "PC\tCo-Chairs\thave\tto\tkeep\tin\tmind\tthe\tcommunity\tof\tauthors,\tthe\treviewers,\tthe\tconference\titself,\tand\teven\tthe\tbroader\tcommunity\tbeyond\tICSE\twhen\tit\tcomes\tto\tthe\tconference’s\treputation.\tGiven\tthis,\tit\tis\tuseful\tto\tconsider\tthe\tfollowing\tpriorities:\t1. Quality\tfirst.\tThe\toverarching\tpurpose\tof\tthe\treview\tprocess\tis\tto\tdevelop\ta\tquality\tprogram\tfor\tICSE.\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s20",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 1779,
          "end": 2095,
          "text": "This\tquality\tmust\tbe\tcarefully\tprotected,\tas\tit\tis\tthe\tkey\tfactor\tdetermining\tthe\treputation\tof\tICSE,\tboth\twithin\tour\tcommunity\tand\toutside\tof\tit.\tFirst\tand\tforemost,\tthus,\tthe\treview\tprocess\tis\tconcerned\twith\tselecting\thigh-quality\tpapers\tthat\twill\tform\tthe\tcore\tof\tthe\tICSE\tconference\tprogram.\t\t2. Authors\tsecond.\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s21",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 2095,
          "end": 2495,
          "text": "ICSE\tis\tcritically\tdependent\ton\tthe\twillingness\tof\tauthors\tto\tsubmit\ttheir\tpapers\tto\tthe\tconference.\tIt\thas\ta\theritage\tof\tbeing\tbroadly\tinclusive,\tboth\tin\tterms\tof\tevolving\ttopics\tof\tinterest\tand\tin\tterms\tof\tnurturing\tthe\tcommunity.\tIt\tmust\tnot\tbe\tforgotten,\tthen,\tthat\tthe\tICSE\treview\tprocess\tserves\tits\tconstituency\tand\tshould\tdo\twhat\tit\tcan\tto\tpromote\tan\tinclusive\tatmosphere.\t3. Reviewers\tthird.\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s22",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 2495,
          "end": 2822,
          "text": "ICSE\tis\talso\tcritically\tdependent\ton\tthe\twillingness\tof\treviewers\tto\tserve\tthe\tconference.\tWithout\tqualified\treviewers\twho\tinvest\ttheir\ttime\tto\treview\tpapers,\tthere\twould\tbe\tno\tconference.\tWhile\tserving\tas\tpart\tof\tthe\treview\tprocess\tis\tan\thonor,\tthe\treview\tprocess\tthus\tshould\talso\ttake\tinto\taccount\twhat\tit\tasks\tof\treviewers.\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s23",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 2822,
          "end": 3101,
          "text": "It\tis\timpossible\tto\tachieve\ta\tperfect\treview\tprocess\tthat\toptimizes\tall\tof\tthese\tpriorities;\ttradeoffs\texist\twith\tnearly\tevery\tdecision\tthat\tis\tmade.\tLimiting\tthe\tnumber\tof\tsubmissions\tfor\tsure\tbenefits\treviewers,\tmight\tincrease\tquality,\tbut\tcertainy\tdisadvantages\tsome\tauthors.\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s24",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 3101,
          "end": 3276,
          "text": "Providing\tthree\treviews\tto\tevery\tpaper\tincreases\tthe\tsatisfaction\tof\tauthors\twith\tthe\treview\tprocess,\tbut\tat\ta\tcost\tof\tincreasing\tthe\treview\tload.\tMany\tother\texamples\texist.\t\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s25",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 3276,
          "end": 3671,
          "text": "Part II: ICSE SC Policy for Changing the Review Process Process Recognizing\tthe\tdifficulties\tassociated\twith\tchoosing\ta\tsatisfactory\treview\tprocess,\tand\treconciling\tthe\tfact\tthat\tPC\tCo-Chairs\tneed\tthe\tability\tto\ttailor\tthe\tprocess\twhile\tthe\tcommunity\thas\ta\tneed\tfor\tlonger-term\tstability,\tICSE\tadopts\tthe\tfollowing\tprocess:\t\nVersion\t1.1\t ICSE\tPC\tChairs\tGuiding\tDocument\t 3\t\n• Approving\tchanges.\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s26",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 3671,
          "end": 4071,
          "text": "Any\tdesired\tchanges\tto\tthe\tICSE\treview\tprocess\tthat\tare\tvisible\tfrom\tan\tauthor\tperspective\t(e.g.,\tdouble\tblind\tor\tnot,\tnumber\tof\treviews\tper\tpaper,\trebuttals,\treview\tratings)\t\tor\trepresent\ta\tsignificant\tdeparture\tfrom\tprevious\tpractice\t(e.g.,\tprogram\tboard\tmodel\tversus\tprogram\tcommittee\tmodel,\tonline\tPB\tor\tPC\tmeeting),\tshould\tbe\tfirst\tpresented\tto\tthe\tICSE\tTechnical\tReview\tsubcommittee,\twith\ta\tdet",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s27",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 4071,
          "end": 4342,
          "text": "ailed\tdescription\tof\tthe\tproblem\tbeing\taddressed,\tan\tanalysis\tof\tpros\tand\tcons,\ta\tcareful\tarticulation\tof\tthe\tpotential\timpact\tof\tthe\tproposed\tchanges\t(especially\tin\tlight\tof\tthe\tabove\tpriorities,\tboth\tpositive\tand\tnegative\timpact),\tand\ta\tplan\tfor\tmeasuring\tthis\timpact.\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s28",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 4342,
          "end": 4724,
          "text": "Changes\twill\tbe\tvetted\tby\tthe\ttechnical\treview\tsubcommittee\t(which\tby\tdefinition\tincludes\tone\tof\tthe\tPC\tCo-Chairs\twho\tmay\tbe\tproposing\tthe\tchanges).\tChanges\tthat\tthe\tICSE\tTechnical\tReview\tsubcommittee\tconsiders\trelatively\tinnocuous\tcan\tbe\tapproved\tby\tthe\tICSE\tTechnical\tReview\tsubcommittee\ttogether\twith\tthe\tSteering\tCommittee\tChair\twithout\tinvolving\tthe\tentire\tSteering\tCommittee.\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s29",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 4724,
          "end": 4977,
          "text": "Changes\tthat\tare\tmore\tcontroversial,\tor\thave\tsignificant\timpact,\twill\tneed\tfull\tapproval\tof\tthe\tSteering\tCommittee.\t\t• Promoting\topenness.\tParticularly\tcontroversial\tor\tdifferent\tchoices\tof\treview\tprocess\tshall\tbe\tsubject\tto\ta\tphase\tof\tcommunity\tinput.\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s30",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 4977,
          "end": 5371,
          "text": "This\tphase\twill\ttake\tplace\tafter\tconsideration\tof\tthe\tICSE\tTechnical\tReview\tsubcommittee,\tbut\tbefore\tconsideration\tby\tthe\tICSE\tSteering\tCommittee\tat\tlarge\tso\tto\tmaximize\tinput\tto\tthe\tdiscussions\tof\tthe\tSteering\tCommittee.\tThe\tchair\tof\tthe\tICSE\tTechnical\tReview\tsubcommittee\tshall\tbe\tresponsible\tfor\tsoliciting\tinput\tfrom\tthe\tbroader\tcommunity\tthrough\ta\ttimely,\tpublic,\tand\tonline\tsolicitation.\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s31",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 5371,
          "end": 5604,
          "text": "This\tcould\ttake\tthe\tform\tof\tan\tonline\tsurvey,\tan\te-mail\trequest\tfor\tcomment,\tor\tpresentation\tat\ta\ttownhall\tmeeting\t(use\tof\tFacebook\tor\tother\tsocial\tmedia\tis\tproblematic\tand\tdiscouraged,\tsince\tit\texcludes\ta\tportion\tof\tour\tcommunity).\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s32",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 5604,
          "end": 5940,
          "text": "Of\tnote\tthat\tis\tthat\tit\tshould\tbe\tmade\tclear\tto\tthe\tcommunity\tthat\tthe\tICSE\tSteering\tCommitttee\tis\tseeking\tits\tinput\tand\tsuggestions,\tbut\tthat\tthe\tcommunity\tis\tnot\tbeing\tasked\tto\tvote\ton\tany\tparticular\tproposal\t–\tthat\tremains\tthe\ttask\tof\tthe\tICSE\tSteering\tCommittee.\tManaging\texpectations,\tthen,\tis\tkey\tto\tany\tround\tof\tcommunity\tinput.\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s33",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 5940,
          "end": 6326,
          "text": "It\tis\tstrongly\tsuggested\tthat\tthe\tICSE\tSteering\tCommittee\talso\tcloses\tthe\tloop\twith\trespect\tto\tthe\tcommunity:\tdecisions\tthat\ttouch\tauthors,\tand\tespecially\tthe\tdecisions\tfor\twhich\tcommunity\tinput\twas\tactually\tsought,\tshould\tbe\tcommunicated\tback\tto\tauthors\tin\ta\ttimely\tand\tideally\topen\tmanner\t(for\tinstance,\tthroug\ta\ttownhall\tor\te-mail\tto\tthe\tICSE\tmailing\tlist).\t• Maintaining\tstability.\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s34",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 6326,
          "end": 6644,
          "text": "To\tprovide\tthe\tcommunity\twith\tstability,\tand\tto\tbe\table\tto\tproperly\tassess\tthe\timpact\tof\ta\tchange\tover\ttime,\tchanges\tto\tthe\treview\tprocess\twill\tremain\tin\teffect\tfor\ta\tminimum\tof\tthree\tyears,\twith\ttwo\texceptions:\to A\tchange\twill\tbe\tretracted\tif\tit\tis\tclear\tthat\tit\thad\tsignificant,\tunanticipated\tnegative\tconsequences.\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s35",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 6644,
          "end": 7042,
          "text": "o A\tchange\tcan\tbe\tamended\twith\ta\tnext\tsuggested\tchange\tif\tthe\tnext\tchange\tis\tdetermined\tby\tthe\tICSE\tTechnical\tReview\tCommitteee\tto\tbe\ta\tfriendly\tamendment,\tin\tline\twith\tthe\tintent\tof\tthe\toriginal\tchange\tand\tattempting\tto\tfurther\timprove\tits\tintended\teffectiveness.\t• Conducting\tassessment.\tAny\tchange\tshall\tbe\taccompanied\twith\ta\tplan\tfor\tassessing\tits\timpact,\tboth\tpositively\tso\tand\tnegatively\tso.\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s36",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 7042,
          "end": 7392,
          "text": "This\tplan\tshall\tbe\tput\tinto\taction\tby\tthe\tPC\tCo-Chairs\t(in\tconsultation\twith\tthe\tICSE\tTechnical\tReview\tsubcommittee,\tif\tso\tdesired),\twith\tthe\tresults\tpresented\tand\treflected\tupon\tin\tthe\tfinal\treport\tfrom\tthe\tPC\tCo-Chairs\tand\tdiscussed,\tas\tneeded,\tduring\ta\tsubsequent\tICSE\tSteering\tCommittee\tmeeting.\t\nVersion\t1.1\t ICSE\tPC\tChairs\tGuiding\tDocument\t 4\t\n",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "s37",
          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 7392,
          "end": 7737,
          "text": "While\tthis\tprocess\tconstrains\tfuture\tPC\tCo-Chairs\tby\tvirtue\tof\tdecisions\tmade\tin\tprevious\tyears,\tthis\tprocess\tbalances\tthe\tneeds\tof\tthe\tvarious\tstakeholders,\thelps\tfuture\tPC\tCo-Chairs\tchairs\tin\tproviding\ta\tblueprint\tof\tthe\treview\tprocess\tupon\twhich\tthey\tcan\tbuild,\tand\tencourages\tcareful\texploration\tof\talternative\treview\tmodels\twhen\tso\tneeded.\t",
          "source_role": "document",
          "source_message_indices": [],
          "time_metadata": {}
        },
        {
