          "doc_id": "web-1e18d2763217bc6048b1fb68",
          "start": 7936,
          "end": 8189,
          "text": "Appendix\tA\tis\tmeant\tto\tserve\tas\tthe\t‘living\tstatement\tof\tthe\tICSE\treview\tprocess\tas\tdecided\tupon\tby\tthe\tICSE\tSteering\tCommittee\t(by\tdelegation\tto\tthe\tICSE\tTechnical\tReview\tsubcommittee)’;\tit\tthus\tshould\tbe\tupdated\taccordingly\twhen\tchanges\tare\tapproved.\t",
